1 REM FBCS ARR-0354
2 REM CLAIM A-7.1.4-TR135
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 7.1.4 l.3056-3057: reaching a DIM again has no further effect, so the array keeps what was assigned.
10 HANDLER H
20 DIM B(2)
30 LET B(2) = 5
40 END HANDLER
50 LET B(1) = 7
60 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
70 CAUSE EXCEPTION 1
80 END WHEN
90 PRINT B(1); B(2)
100 END
